IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-BITBLAS-GEMV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-M               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DIM-K               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BIT-WIDTH           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-BITBLAS.
    IF DIM-M == 0 OR DIM-K == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF BIT-WIDTH == 0
        MOVE 4 TO BIT-WIDTH.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 38 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SPEEDUP-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 BIT-WIDTH.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
